From: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 13:06:15 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] media: apple: isp: add IMX958 P010 preview and config
 discovery
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Port the processed config-5 preview command sequence from our m1n1 J616s work, with contiguous V4L2 P010 strides and pool geometry. Query all advertised H17 sensor configs and retain the board defaults while appending consistent output modes. Keep NV12 the default and scope the new path to T6040/IMX958.

Retire output and metadata leases after the report ACK, restart an empty P010 queue on requeue, bound ring servicing and latch malformed or timed-out command replies. Add command-byte, geometry, ownership and ring-wrap coverage. These source corrections still require sustained capture validation on 26.6.2.

Builds on Jonathan Goyvaerts’ T6040 camera support in PR #384. Protocol reference: our m1n1 PR #20 at 9be380c8a5 and Linux PR #231 at a4e7ee86bc5e. No firmware payload is included.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
